I have used this trick often and I think it is the best way to get great
stuff--especially if you can get a polymorph spell and an identify spell.
Then you just pile up as much stuff as you want and then identify it.  If
you don't like what it turns into, just do it again!! Try
it on EVERYTHING you find (hint, hint).

In answer to your question, the curse/uncursed/blessed status remains but
the type of object changes (though it stays in its same class--i.e. weapons
only polymorph into weapons).


